<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific 1996 net up 27.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific 1996 net up 27.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	    119.6  vs  104.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	41.5  vs  37.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items  (gain) 541.0  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			     3,809  vs  2,978</p>
<p>    Turnover		     32,381  vs  30,454</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 5-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Airline Cathay Pacific is 43.9 percent owned by Swire Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Exceptional item due to gain from sale of 12.21 percent of Hong Kong Dragon Airlines Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year 53 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 11.5 cents) vs 48 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
